// bipyramid edge (8 solid)   → CylinderGeometry r=0.022, olive #8CC63F
// rear equatorial edge       → dashed chain of short cylinders, #7FAF37
// equatorial plane           → BufferGeometry triangle, MeshBasicMaterial #DCE9B8 op .45, depthWrite:false, DoubleSide
